# "For each 1 damage prevented this way" (CR 615.7, 616.1): only what Sacred Boon's own shield prevented counts, not another
# shield's on the same creature. Bot1's Ornithopter gets Healing Salve's shield (3) and Sacred Boon's (3) in response to Bot2's
# first Shock; Bot1 has the Salve apply first to each Shock: it prevents all of the first (2) and the last 1 of the second,
# leaving 1 for Sacred Boon. 4 damage was prevented to the Ornithopter in all, but only 1 by Sacred Boon: at the end step it
# gets 1 +0/+1 counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Ornithopter
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Plains
Healing Salve
Sacred Boon
Plains
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
